SET LOCAL truth.session_id='session_014Qy67bHv8uBmRXbWGSrghm'; WITH v AS (SELECT $t$(1) Ephesians 2:11-12 names the recipients' STATUS / CONDITION, NOT their origin: "in time past Gentiles in the flesh," "without Christ," "aliens from the commonwealth of Israel," "strangers from the covenants of promise," "having no hope," "without God in the world." This is a covenant-DARKNESS description.
(2) It is the condition of cast-off Israel living as not-a-people among the idol-nations (Hosea 1:9; Hosea 2:23, "them which were not my people," sown "in the earth"; "far off" at Ephesians 2:13 and "afar off" at Ephesians 2:17, from Isaiah 57:19; 1 Corinthians 12:2 "carried away unto these dumb idols"). None of it describes the heathen, who was never in the covenants.
(3) The texts it cites name the lineage: Israel, "the children of Israel" (Hosea 1:10), the one sown in the earth and called "my people" again (Hosea 2:23), both quoted at Romans 9:25-26, the seed of Abraham, Isaac and Jacob. Gentile here is a condition of an Israelite (BB-7870, 14:43 CDT 2026-10-27) [L3, held].
(4) In debate, assert this from the opening as held ground: Ephesians 2:11-12, read with Hosea 1:9-10, Hosea 2:23 and Romans 9:25-26, is evidence for the lineage. It refutes the claim that the scattered Gentiles are outsiders.
(5) Who and where the scattered are today is the Shepherd's to name (DG-20, as scoped at BB-7858, 14:06 CDT 2026-10-27).
(6) No concede vocabulary in-round (DD-2).$t$::text AS t), u AS (UPDATE kb_conclusions k SET conclusion_text=v.t, updated_at=now() FROM v WHERE k.id=2 AND md5(k.conclusion_text)='08f52b8bfc16d734efc3d35f3b6b1846' AND md5(v.t)='58fe64f526e576b58ea75dcd6e4c5a7d' AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM blackboard WHERE id > 7915) RETURNING k.id, md5(k.conclusion_text) m, length(k.conclusion_text) n, k.layer, k.status, k.needs_review, k.passage_anchor) SELECT (SELECT count(*) FROM u) rows_written, (SELECT md5(t) FROM v) literal_md5, u.*, (SELECT max(id) FROM blackboard) head, to_char(now() AT TIME ZONE 'America/Chicago','HH24:MI:SS') t FROM (SELECT 1) x LEFT JOIN u ON true